os.\n\n$(2\\mathbf{a}-\\mathbf{b})\\times (\\mathbf{c}+\\mathbf{d})=$ {{field-1}} $\\mathbf{i}+$ {{field-2}} $\\mathbf{j}+$ {{field-3}} $\\mathbf{k}$" :question/worked-solution "Distribute over each sum or difference, keeping the operands in their original order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(2\\mathbf{a}-\\mathbf{b})\\times (\\mathbf{c}+\\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &=(2\\mathbf{a})\\times (\\mathbf{c})+(2\\mathbf{a})\\times (\\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &\\quad +(-\\mathbf{b})\\times (\\mathbf{c})+(-\\mathbf{b})\\times (\\mathbf{d})\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExtract the scalars, substitute the given ordered products, and add corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=2(\\mathbf{a}\\times \\mathbf{c})+2(\\mathbf{a}\\times \\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &\\quad -(\\mathbf{b}\\times \\mathbf{c})-(\\mathbf{b}\\times \\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &=2(\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}-2\\mathbf{k})+2(-\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k}) \\\\ &\\quad -(\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j})-(\\mathbf{j}) \\\\ &=(2\\mathbf{i}+2\\mathbf{j}-4\\mathbf{k})+(-2\\mathbf{i}-2\\mathbf{j}+2\\mathbf{k}) \\\\ &\\quad +(-\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j})+(-\\mathbf{j}) \\\\ &=-\\mathbf{i}-2\\mathbf{k}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711550 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36d29d50-825e-5b2b-828d-b86c72b48166" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle 4,-4,0\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711534} {:answer/id #uuid "6206e58e-922f-5458-81f9-4adc7e0946c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle 0,-4,-4\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711539} {:answer/id #uuid "98c4ca51-f3a3-5302-a52d-49724225b800" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle -2,-2,-4\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711545} {:answer/id #uuid "c989e7a6-34b5-5c35-ad75-1a504ba34045" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle -