end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711558 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bcc32f97-103a-57a4-ab14-62abe15ad27d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711552}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711552} :answer-field/id #uuid "276ed5aa-0a26-5680-9c92-309ffd52db46" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711533} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "466758b5-c158-5008-b95b-89315cf591b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711536}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711536} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ad4a1e5-20c3-51db-8698-911490652559" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711535} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "131e852c-7822-5619-b294-4a4995b63fbe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711532}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711532} :answer-field/id #uuid "c16cfcbc-b57b-5edb-b278-afe697a0642d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711553}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f508d019-5192-521f-88f9-60582d086717" :question/problem "Find $(-2\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b})\\times (-\\mathbf{c}+\\mathbf{d})$, given\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{a}\\times \\mathbf{c}&=-\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k} \\\\ \\mathbf{a}\\times \\mathbf{d}&=2\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k} \\\\ \\mathbf{b}\\times \\mathbf{c}&=-\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k} \\\\ \\mathbf{b}\\times \\mathbf{d}&=\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEnter the signed components, including any zeros.\n\n$(-2\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b})\\times (-\\mathbf{c}+\\mathbf{d})=$ {{field-1}} $\\mathbf{i}+$ {{field-2}} $\\mathbf{j}+$ {{field-3}} $\\mathbf{k}$" :question/worked-solution "Distribute over each sum or difference, keeping the operands in their original order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(-2\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b})\\times (-\\mathbf{c}+\\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &=(-2\\mathbf{a})\\times (-\\mathbf{c})+(-2\\mathbf{a})\\times (\\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &\\quad +(\\mathbf{b})\\times (-\\mathbf{c})+(\\mathbf{b})\\times (\\mathbf{d})\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExtract the scalars, substitute the given ordered products, and add corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=2(\\mathbf{a}\\times \\mathbf{c})-2(\\mathbf{a}\\times \\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &\\quad -(\\mathbf{b}\\times \\mathbf{c})+(\\mathbf{b}\\times \\mathbf{d}) \\\\ &=2(-\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k})-2(2\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k}) \\\\ &\\quad -(-\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k})+(\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}) \\\\ &=(-2\\mathbf{i}-2\\mathbf{j}+2\\mathbf{k})+(-4\\mathbf{i}+2\\mathbf{j}-2\\mathbf{k}) \\\\ &\\quad +(\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}-\\mathbf{k})+(\\mathbf{i}-\\mathbf{j}) \\\\ &=-4\\mathbf{i}-2\\mathbf{j}-\\mathbf{k}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711668 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b7a8d6da-8aed-58bb-bad1-8dab89fb9aa5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711682}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711682} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc9f9c95-0f90-5e4f-bfbb-a81de981a886" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711684} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c841709-9bdb-5309-9cd6-1828ed5787b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.typ